  "description": "Jaegun Ha is an unsuccessful novelist at 27 years old with nothing to show for himself. That is until he discovers a mysterious box of items and a cat in a graveyard! Now Jaegun is able to channel the extraordinary writing abilities of a dead writer named Gunwoo Seo, and Jaegun’s career is propelled to celebrity status. But with the perks of success come new challenges... \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
